  "description": "Do-Hyeon is not a very noticeable guy on campus. Seung-Ju, his junior, happens to become close with Do-Hyeon by doing group projects together. But then Seung-Ju starts becoming curious about Do-Hyeon, who for some odd reason is blunt only with him.\n\nIn fact, Do-Hyeon has a secret crush on Seung-Ju, and his feelings are growing...\n\n(Source: BookCube, translated) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes one extra.*",
